# The image build reads only docker/ (the Dockerfile, the entrypoint, the apt lists) and the toolchain file. Everything else
# is left out of the build context: the repository's own target folder alone is tens of gigabytes.
*
!docker
docker/*
!docker/apt-packages.txt
!docker/apt-packages-bench.txt
!docker/entrypoint.sh
!tools/lint/requirements.txt
!tools/lint/package.json
!tools/lint/package-lock.json
!rust-toolchain.toml
